# Hosting rules for the complete DermiQ package (Netlify and compatible hosts).
# This file must sit next to index.html, at the top of the uploaded folder.

# The package also carries the source code, the documents and a few helper files.
# They are for the project team, not for visitors ("!" = apply even though the file exists):
/source/*      /    302!
/docs/*        /    302!
/README.txt    /    302!
/serve.mjs     /    302!

# The app keeps its pages after the "#" (/#/product), so the only real page is "/".
# Anything else that is not a real file goes back to the home page instead of "Page not found".
/*             /    302
